  (jv$clojure.core/attach-core-doc-meta! "clojure.core" "future" "Takes a body of expressions and yields a future object that will\n  invoke the body in another thread, and will cache the result and\n  return it on all subsequent calls to deref/@. If the computation has\n  not yet finished, calls to deref/@ will block, unless the variant of\n  deref with timeout is used. See also - realized?." (jolt-list (jolt-vector (jolt-symbol #f "&") (jolt-symbol #f "body"))) jolt-nil))
